      <memberdef kind="define" id="group__x430__config_1ga668d14fe97878bd22dccbd6508ed916b" prot="public" static="no">
        <name>DXL2_MAX_PACKET_SIZE</name>
        <initializer>768U</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Largest packet of the DXL2-C link, in bytes (default 768: a READ of the whole Control Table, as DYNAMIXEL Wizard does it). </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Defined here, before dxl2.h is included, so that every translation unit that includes <ref refid="x430_8h_source" kindref="compound">x430.h</ref> sees the size the library was built with (the instance size of a bus depends on it). DXL2-C itself must be compiled with the same value; x430.cmake passes it to DXL2-C. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
        <location file="inc/x430_config.h" line="65" column="10" bodyfile="inc/x430_config.h" bodystart="65" bodyend="-1"/>
