    <briefdescription>
<para>Build-time configuration: Kconfig symbols or plain compiler definitions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The values come from three places, highest priority first: <itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>a compiler definition of the X430_* macro itself (for example <computeroutput>-DX430_MAX_DEVICES=8U</computeroutput>); </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para>the Kconfig header x430_autoconf.h (CONFIG_X430_* symbols), included when the build defines X430_HAS_AUTOCONF; </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para>the defaults below.</para>
</listitem>
</itemizedlist>
The emulated model is not configured here: CMake generates its Control Table (x430_model_table.c) and x430_model_info.h for the model selected with Kconfig or with the X430_MODEL cache variable. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
